title: FirstDialogueStart
---
Billy: Good morning Sir.
HotdogSeller: Good morning.
Billy: Can you give me a hotdog?
HotdogSeller: Sure, it will cost only 3$
Billy: Uhmm, eh, sir I have no money.
-> May I pay you tomorrow?
-> Do you know giving food to others make people happy?
-> Don't you have a free hotdog samples to give?
HotdogSeller: Sorry buddy, no money no hotdog
Billy: oh crap, ok. Maybe I'll come back later.
HotdogSeller: Bye
===
